{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Touhou Project Volume 20  <br>A bullet hell shooter by Team Shanghai Alice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This commemorative 20th installment returns to its roots.  <br>It offers a classic style that lets you enjoy bullet hell shooting in its purest form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players take on the roles of Reimu and Marisa.  <br>Combine the eight unique \u201cAnomaly Stones\u201d to equip yourself and face the anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the unique world and story of Touhou.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Story -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something was happening in Gensokyo.  <br>However, only a few noticed it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The only signs of something amiss were<br>the sacred sanctuary at the foot of the mountain, an untouchable place,<br>and the power of the anomalies themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed with the power she gained from resolving previous anomalies, she sets out to confront the sacred sanctuary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* This is a demo version. Some features are limited, and the story is only available up to a certain point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game content may also change in the future. Please enjoy the bullet hell gameplay with this in mind.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3675420?t=1746837234","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675420/69f9206791014f7ac07c677e5a29ba6b971473fd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746837234","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675420/ce99b293f52f0bc1e5b6e40a3e63694cac7090b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746837234","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675420/ce99b293f52f0bc1e5b6e40a3e63694cac7090b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746837234","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Touhou Project Volume 20  <br>A bullet hell shooter by Team Shanghai Alice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This commemorative 20th installment returns to its roots.  <br>It offers a classic style that lets you enjoy bullet hell shooting in its purest form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players take on the roles of Reimu and Marisa.  <br>Combine the eight unique \u201cAnomaly Stones\u201d to equip yourself and face the anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the unique world and story of Touhou.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Story -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something was happening in Gensokyo.  <br>However, only a few noticed it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The only signs of something amiss were<br>the sacred sanctuary at the foot of the mountain, an untouchable place,<br>and the power of the anomalies themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed with the power she gained from resolving previous anomalies, she sets out to confront the sacred sanctuary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* This is a demo version. Some features are limited, and the story is only available up to a certain point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game content may also change in the future. Please enjoy the bullet hell gameplay with this in mind.</p>","developers":["\u4e0a\u6d77\u30a2\u30ea\u30b9\u5e7b\u6a02\u56e3"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3671710","name":"Touhou Kinjoukyou \uff5e Fossilized Wonders."},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675420/e746766860fdf18b3f05c482ede05220cb8d8ce6/header.jpg?t=1746837234","is